WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Open the restaurant area
Signing in is required to view and advance orders.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Try an incorrect password
Access is rejected; the public catalogue remains separate from the restaurant area.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Sign in with atelier in this demo
The restaurant shows the same order and total.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Move to Preparing
The restaurant advances the status manually; no AI autonomy is demonstrated.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Refresh tracking on the customer side
Preparing matches the restaurant action.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Move to Out for delivery
The steps are traversed in order.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Move to Delivered then refresh the customer
Tracking confirms fictitious delivery of the same order number.
